The following parts of crates/mlx-rust are adapted from that project, with
modifications:

  src/module/       the parameter tree, `Param<T>` and the `Module` traits
  src/nn/           the layer set
  src/optimizers/   the optimizer set

Modifications include keying parameter trees by insertion order (`indexmap`)
rather than `HashMap`, so that checkpoint and optimizer-state output is
reproducible.

mlx-rust also links MLX (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx) and mlx-c
(https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-c), both Copyright (c) Apple Inc., licensed
under the MIT license.
